      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 460,
        "color": 4,
        "content": "## 08 · AI Customer Onboarding\nWhen a new customer signs up, AI builds a personalised onboarding plan and welcome email; enterprise accounts get a CSM alert.\n\n**Trigger:** `POST /webhook/customer-onboarding` (JSON body)\n\n**Setup**\n1. Edit the **Config** node (model, sheet URL, endpoints).\n2. Connect credentials: Gmail OAuth2, Google Sheets OAuth2, OpenAI API, Slack.\n3. Pick Slack channels / sheet tabs on the action nodes.\n4. Activate.\n\n**Sample payload:**\n```json\n{\n \"name\": \"Meera\",\n \"email\": \"meera@bigcorp.com\",\n \"company\": \"BigCorp\",\n \"plan\": \"Enterprise\",\n \"seats\": 120,\n \"use_case\": \"customer support automation\"\n}\n```"
      }
